# A squat terracotta urn (manifest: urn, 14 px tall): a wide rim with a dark band under it, a
# short neck, a round belly on a small foot; shaded from the style guide's light (top left) and
# outlined in the style guide's ink. It stands on the bottom rows.
new sprite urn
ellipse 5,12 14x9 c=clay2 fill
rect 9,20 6x2 c=clay2 fill
rect 9,11 6x2 c=clay2 fill
rect 8,10 8x1 c=clay3 fill
line 8,11 15,11 c=clay0
shade ramp=clay
# Shade leaves a few lone steps at the rim, the neck and the foot: even them out.
px 14,10 c=clay3
px 14,13 15,13 c=clay1
px 8,19 9,20 c=clay2
# A glint on the shoulder of the belly, and the foot in shadow.
px 8,14 9,14 8,15 c=clay4
line 10,21 13,21 c=clay1
outline
